{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"73c4e3226421fa9099ffa7e3becd4d8452e13a083d5791c9c10e53374d7c3fa4","digest":{"component_or_area":"rebar↔Jira mapping layer (S5 priority + create_defaults)","key_entities":["mapping_config.py:MappingLayer","config.py:effective_priority_map","config.py:effective_create_defaults","config.py:local_to_jira_priority","outbound_differ.py:_effective_priority_map_for","outbound_differ.py:_effective_create_defaults_for","outbound_mutation_builders.py","outbound_field_diff.py:compute_update_fields","outbound_mapper.py:resolve_outbound_priority","value_maps.py:LOCAL_PRIORITY_TO_JIRA","adapters/jira/outbound_fields.py:_map_local_to_jira_fields","adapters/jira_datacenter/backend.py:_map_local_to_dc_fields","_backend.py:OutboundMapper","reset_drift_warnings"],"problem_keywords":["priority mapping","config-driven","create defaults","jira sync","rebar mapping","priority drift","outbound mutation"],"propositions":["Priority mapping must be config-driven via str-keyed project-level axes, with unmapped priorities drifting (omitting field, warn-once) rather than failing sync","create_defaults must be resolved as str-valued per-project config and merged into create payloads for required-beyond-baseline fields, with baseline fields winning collisions","Both priority_map and create_defaults must be threaded as optional kwargs (defaulting None) through CREATE carriers (map_local_to_remote) and UPDATE carriers (map_fields_to_remote, priority_map only)","Unmapped priority values must resolve to None via resolve_outbound_priority and trigger a warning using the reset_drift_warnings sink, causing the priority field to be omitted from the remote payload","Config baseline for priority must be str-keyed dict matching value_maps.LOCAL_PRIORITY_TO_JIRA keys without importing it, re-declared in-module per status pattern","Test doubles with explicit status_map parameter must gain priority_map and create_defaults (where applicable), while **kwargs/varargs absorb new parameters unchanged"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787805891569049001,"uuid":"dac4fbbc-b5de-4ed9-bbe8-ed36eb0f4a1b"}